        "title": {
            "rendered": "Adam Bromley: Hyper-Connected"
        },
        "content": {
            "rendered": "<p>Follow Adam on his journey from analogue childhood to online adult life. Can he stop doomscrolling? How do you make real connections when everyone else is on social media? Join one man's hilarious quest to be present in the here and now, when digital distractions are everywhere. This is a brand new stand-up show from the two times winner of the Sony award for radio comedy.</p>\n",
            "protected": false
        },
        "meta": {
