        "slug": "not-another-quiz-night",
        "link": "https://www.brightonfringe.org/performances/not-another-quiz-night/",
        "title": {
            "rendered": "Not Another Quiz Night"
        },
        "content": {
            "rendered": "<p>After a hit run at the Edinburgh Fringe and moving to London's Clapham Grand Theatre, Not Another Quiz Night makes it's debut at the Brighton Fringe!</p>\n<p>Join Jake Bhardwaj and his team of \u2018celebrity\u2019 guests for the most chaotic, high-energy quiz show in town. This isn\u2019t just a quiz \u2013 it\u2019s a full-blown spectacular. Expect music, comedy, mayhem, interactive bonus rounds, ridiculous prizes, surprise appearances. Whether you're a quiz whiz or just here for the party, there's something for everyone.</p>\n<p>'Consistently one of the most entertaining and mad things I\u2019ve seen.\u2019 Joe Lycett<br />'One of those rare shows that makes controlled chaos look effortless.' Jordan Gray</p>\n",
            "protected": false
        },
        "meta": {
            "_acf_changed": false,
